    RequestsResolvedToNothing RequestsResolvedToUpcast RequestsResolvedToClaim RequestsResolvedToReport
    RequestsResolvedToPrediction RequestsAdmittingObjects PositionsAdmittingObjects AssertedObjectsPassedToUnknownCallees RequestsAdmittingOtherKinds PositionsAdmittingOtherKinds
    FlowNodes FlowEdges FlowWorklistSteps FlowInstances FlowLiteralSets FlowAllocationSites FlowAllocationClasses FlowProvenPositions FlowUnprovenPositions
    FlowStatementRuns FlowStatementRunsWithoutChange FlowStatementWakeUps FlowStatementsStartedOver FlowMembersRepeated FlowCursorsNotReached
