    FlowGenericVersions FlowCallSiteVersions FlowDerivedLayouts FlowUnreachedFunctions FlowAppendedFields FlowProvenBases FlowDeferredClosureFields FlowConstructorsLeakingThis
    FlowSetsOutsideTypes
    AccessesProven AccessesWritten AccessesPredicted AccessesUnknown DirectCalls IndirectCalls GroupCalls
    ClosuresFull ClosuresSlim ClosuresDeferred ClosuresInFrames ClosuresNeverCreated EnvironmentsOnHeap EnvironmentsInFrames ObjectsInFrames
    EnvironmentsMaterializedLate EnvironmentsReused EnvironmentsPromotedToVariables CapturesPromotedToVariables
    AggregateParametersPromoted FreshResultsSplit ResultsReturnedInRegisters ResultClonesCreated UnusedResultsRemoved UnusedParametersRemoved
