    BodySummariesComputed BodySummariesKept EffectSummaryNodes EffectSummaryNodesInAndAboveCycles
    FunctionsTypedFromNever FunctionsTypedFromChanges FunctionsTypedAsBefore
    StackChecksCoveredByCallers StackChecksDeferredToCallee TailRecursionsEliminated ReturnCallsDemoted ResultsBoxedForTailCalls SecondaryEntries
    StretchesGuarded TypeTestsPlaced StretchesNotClonable GuardsEliminated EpochTestsInserted UnionsSplit
    AllocationsRemoved AllocationsSunk AllocationsMergedAtJoins StoresFoldedIntoAllocations TailsDuplicatedForSinking
    LoopsSeparatedFromUnlikelyPaths LoopsWithoutWayBack LoopsWithVersions LoopVersionsCreated BytesCopiedForLoopVersions
    InlineDecisionUnknown InlineDecisionInline InlineDecisionInlineHead InlineDecisionBarrier InlineDecisionSignatureMismatch InlineDecisionClosesCycle
