    InlineBenefitKnownCalleeArgument InlineBenefitKnownReceiver InlineBenefitSunkAllocation InlineBenefitOnlyCallSite InlineBenefitWrapper
    CallsResolved CallsGuarded DispatchArms ConstructsResolved AwaitedCallsResolved BuiltinReadsResolved BuiltinCallsResolved BuiltinConversionsInserted
    GenericEntrypoints GroupEntrypoints BoundFunctions CoroutinesSplit GeneratorLoopsFused ArrayChainsFused StringBuildersCreated StringBuildersJoined
    ConcatenationsFused IterationsExpandedByClass IterationsExpandedGenerically EnumeratedKeyUsesResolved OwnKeyWalksExpanded TypedResultsSelected
    ParsersCreated SerializersCreated ValidatorsCreated
    CountersConverted IntegerDivisionsReduced ArrayCapacitiesPlanned ArrayGrowthsPlanned ArraysNarrowed LiteralStringsNumbered
    Slots SharedSlots SharesRefused FieldsOutOfLine HiddenWordsPlaced DeferredClosureSlots Shapes ShapeTestNeverPasses ShapeTestRange ShapeTestBitSet
    SiteCachesPlaced SitesWithoutSiteCache GuardBitsPlaced RequestsShared ClassMembersCreatedByClassRecord ClassMembersCreatedAtDefinition
    ClassesCreatedLazily SlimClosureFunctions FullClosureFunctions KeysWithoutColumn TypeSiteTextsLeftOut
    ConversionsInserted ValuesInInt32 ValuesInInt64 ValuesInDouble ValuesBoxed ReferencesCompressed ExactIntegersBehindNumbers NumbersUnboxedWithoutBranch
    TypeChecksInB3 TypeChecksByOperation ThrowSites ShortStringsReadInPlace CopyOnWriteArraysCreatedInline BarriersEmitted BarriersOnUnmarkableOwners BarriersCoveredLater SuspensionRoots NarrowReferenceGuards NarrowReferencesAcrossSafepoints NarrowReferencesStoredInFrames FunctionsWithoutFrame FunctionsWithFrameOnSomePaths
    FunctionsEnteredWithoutStackCheck
    ProgramTableBytesTypes ProgramTableBytesLayouts ProgramTableBytesFieldTable ProgramTableBytesStatics ProgramTableBytesFunctions ProgramTableBytesModules ProgramTableBytesRequests
    ProgramTableBytesData ProgramTableBytesOther
    StubsGenerated StubBytes CodeUnitsRecorded FunctionsFolded BytesFolded JumpOnlyFunctionsRemoved BodiesOutlined BytesOutlined JumpsToNextFunctionRemoved
    Veneers StubCopiesEmitted CodeBytesEmitted TableBytesEmitted LoopsVersioned LoopsRotated LoopPollsStripMined RangeChecksRemoved
    LoopBoundsClamped KnownInductionsUsed
    NullChecksFoldedIntoAccesses
    ImageFunctionsEmitted FrameShapesEmitted CallSiteBytesEmitted LargestSiteCountInFunction LargestInlineFrameCountInFunction TextBytesEmitted
    ConstantBytesEmitted StringConstantsNumbered IdentifiersNumbered
    RegExpsCompiled RegExpsInterpreted RegExpFramesElided RegExpAtoms RegExpCandidatesCompiled RegExpCandidatesDropped RegExpAnalysisLimitHits
    WasmFunctionsCompiled WasmFunctionsInterpreted
